# 9. Prefix Sum Concept

One of the most important concepts in CP.

Array:

```python
[1,2,3,4,5]
```

Prefix Sum:

```text
[1,3,6,10,15]
```

Implementation:

```python
arr = [1,2,3,4,5]

prefix = [0]*len(arr)

prefix[0] = arr[0]

for i in range(1,len(arr)):
    prefix[i] = prefix[i-1] + arr[i]

print(prefix)
```

Output:

```text
[1,3,6,10,15]
```

Complexity:

```text
O(n)
```

