# 10. Frequency Counting

Very common in CP.

```python
arr = [1,2,2,3,3,3]

freq = {}

for x in arr:
    freq[x] = freq.get(x,0)+1

print(freq)
```

Output:

```text
{1:1, 2:2, 3:3}
```

